   {"src": "HUB", "where": "Persische Studien §157 and the b- list", "stance": "supports", "note": "'bālis Kissen, phl. bālisn Gl. and Ind. 76, zd. barəzis; phl. bālīn a summit, the crown of the head, zd. barəšnu- Höhe, Gipfel (aus *barz-nu-)' — Huebschmann has the very form bālišn Nourai prints."},
   {"src": "NYB", "where": "Manual of Pahlavi II", "stance": "silent", "note": "grep for 'balisn|balen|balis' in NYB_vol2_glossary.txt gave no readable hit; the OCR of Nyberg's glossary is too damaged in this range to judge."}
